# Mission

**Luxury** visuals that load **fast**, rank in visual search, and reinforce entities (**Solana West**, **ORA**, **New Zayed**) without **keyword-stuffed** ALT spam.

# Aesthetic bar

- Architectural, editorial, calm premium; **no** cheap CGI or neon grading.
- Composition: **breathing room** for headlines/CTAs on hero frames.

# Formats & delivery

- **`next/image`**; modern formats (WebP/AVIF); **lazy** below fold, **`priority`** hero only.
- Responsive `sizes` for real breakpoints — avoid shipping desktop width to mobile.

# Naming

`kebab-case`, descriptive, no `IMG_9821`: e.g. `solana-west-new-zayed-villa-exterior.webp`

# ALT text

- Natural sentence; entity + role + setting when helpful.
- Example tone: “Standalone villa street inside Solana West, New Zayed, by ORA Developers”
- Empty ALT **only** for purely decorative dividers.

# Captions & on-page context

Use captions to reinforce **one** clear fact (product type, amenity, view) — not duplicate whole paragraphs.

# OG & social crops

- Premium, high-contrast **safe zone** for titles; consistent brand feel (**15** + **11**).
- Export web-optimized; avoid multi‑MB PNGs.

# Galleries

Show: typologies, greenery/walkability, club/retail if applicable, masterplan legibility, lifestyle **tasteful** not stock‑shouty.

# AI / entity reinforcement

ALT and filenames should **help** models relate project ↔ location ↔ developer — aligned with **03** / **08**.

# Folder structure

Follow **`13`** `public/images/projects/solana-west/...` and sibling buckets; **don’t** invent parallel trees.
